.TH TELACHAT-GTK 1 "2026-05-25" "Telachat 0.16.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
telachat-gtk \- start the GTK desktop frontend for Telachat
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B telachat-gtk
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B telachat-gtk
starts the native GTK4/Libadwaita desktop frontend. It uses the same
configuration, SQLite history, provider profiles, folders, prompt templates,
and slash commands as the
.B telachat
CLI.
Saved chats restore their provider and model selectors when loaded.
The System pane exposes a Theme selector. The persistent value is stored in
\fIconfig.toml\fR as \fBtheme\fR and can be temporarily overridden with
\fBTELACHAT_THEME\fR.
.PP
The prompt supports Slash-Command suggestions while typing. Press Tab to
complete the current command and Shift+Enter to send a message.
Use \fB/edit-last TEXT\fR to replace the latest user message and remove the
following answer before regenerating.
Use \fB/fork [TITLE]\fR to copy the current conversation into a new independent
chat variant.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/telachat/config.toml
Default configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/telachat/history.sqlite3
SQLite chat history.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR telachat (1),
.BR telachat-tk (1)
